  [tags store mem status heads head-set refs-plane 719]
  [; the per-stream HEAD-SET (distributed_store L177: a staleness scalar is
     insufficient; store.md's status sentence promises 'heads' and porcelain
     emitted none — #719 item 1's local half). Streams are the E3 lineage
     streams: 'docs' plus one 'aliases/<name>' per ref; a ref stream carries
     its current head hash. The ahead/behind comparison against a peer rides
     stream 9 (#681) — this is the local coordinate it compares. ]
